== Effects ==
* Grants 1 free [[Devil Room|Devil Deal]] item in exchange for the trinket.	
** After a Devil Deal has been taken, the trinket is removed from Isaac's inventory.
** Also works in {{R|Black Market}}s and all other places where [[Health#Red Heart Containers|heart containers]] can be exchanged for an item.

== Notes ==
* Your Soul has no effect on Devil Deals that cost money instead of health, such as from {{t|Keeper's Bargain}}, or playing {{c|Keeper}} and {{c|Tainted Keeper}}.
* {{dlc|rnr+}} Using Your Soul as {{c|The Lost}} / {{c|Tainted Lost}} grants the possibility of taking two items from the Devil Deal instead of only one.
** {{dlc|r+}} The trinket gets consumed but you still can only take a single item from devil deals.
* Using Your Soul still counts as taking a Devil Deal for the purpose of determining {{R|Angel Room}} eligibility.
* Taking multiple deals at the same time with {{C|Jacob and Esau}} will make both free. The trinket will still be removed.

== Interactions ==
* {{A|Golden Trinket|r+}} / {{I|Mom's Box|r+}}: Adds +10% chance to not be consumed per copy.
* '''Multiple copies''': Only one Soul is consumed taking a deal, allowing other copies to be spent separately.

